4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IyzX99q98y8Q7kNvwEsHeYt&_nc_oc=AdrxpyYB9tPAdU5eHLP1ynh_zzM-NQ3ZyJyXxIKtXuiMoRBQUYZfmnmQ9nKoHeV8hyY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3fZBotxrtAifbvX8duDgQLu_2F6zXfy-8-PE6MTWBjqA&oe=69F35354"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PsSPwGzLTAIQ7kNvwEb8ikx&_nc_oc=Ado_xK_98Ik6Y_X1kTVkk2OVx8_n8MpscHIcWgYxxwA1BHN4NoeurVBwZMIhGSMaEgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af07pICFzhT4OdeQB8Mj7DgLYR5vE35W51uiEWr1we65SQ&oe=69F35832"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ui2CmefkFacQ7kNvwFEM0oS&_nc_oc=AdqQhYbuIVONwWtTC8T8S4xp3uXBuwRV_pKJq6F3yzasouN4-aeryuZPYLxkGzeKIMM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3mM7uOikT4CpDMgrV-xWVYD2IuAW_pMyT9HAArP-p0Tg&oe=69F365D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p